ious primary bedroom includes an ensuite bathroom, while the inviting living area opens to a private patio where you can relax and enjoy beautiful golf course views. Additional conveniences include an in-unit laundry and two assigned parking spaces, providing comfort and convenience for everyday living. Residents of the Diamond Bar Tennis Club community enjoy an outstanding selection of resort-style amenities, including three swimming pools and spas, multiple tennis and pickleball courts, a clubhouse, and a billiards room\u2014offering endless opportunities for recreation, relaxation, and social gatherings. Ideally located just minutes from the I-60, I-57, and I-71 freeways, this home is close to Sycamore Canyon Park, directly across the street from the Diamond Bar Golf Course, and just a short drive to Cal Poly Pomona and Mt. San Antonio College. Enjoy convenient access to nearby shopping, restaurants, and everyday amenities. Combining stylish upgrades, resort-style amenities, and picturesque golf course views, this move-in-ready condo is an exceptional opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors alike. Don\u2019t miss your chance to own this turnkey gem in one of Diamond Bar\u2019s most sought-after communities!", "remarksLength": 1936, "listedBy": "Marisol Navar", "propertyTypeName": "Condo/Co-op", "totalSqft": 655, "history": [{"date": "2026-08-27", "event": "Price Changed", "price": 385000, "source": "CRMLS"}, {"date": "2026-07-20", "event": "Listed", "price": 395000, "source": "CRMLS"}, {"date": "2026-03-19", "event": "Sold (MLS)", "price": 379000, "source": "CRMLS"}, {"date": "2026-03-19", "event": "Sold (Public Records)", "price": 379000, "source": "Public Records"}, {"date": "2026-03-06", "event": "Contingent", "price": null, "source": "CRMLS"}, {"date": "2025-11-18", "event": "Price Changed", "price": 379000, "source": "CRMLS"}, {"date": "2025-10-31", "event": "Price Changed", "price": 399000, "source": "CRMLS"}, {"date": "2025-10-23", "eve